WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Smash Kurata's Ambitions

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Fly, Yatagaramon

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.810
Smash Kurata's Ambitions!

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.500
Fly, Yatagaramon!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.790
Masaru and the others met Mercurimon once again.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:18.890
However, what they learned from him was the shocking truth.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:24.700
The cause of Yukidarumon's death and the profound hatred Digimon have of humans

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.160
was all due to the Digimon massacre led by Kurata.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.680
His true nature revealed, Kurata used a mysterious Digimon

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:38.530
named Gizmon:AT to attack Mercurimon from behind and mortally wounded him.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.240
Kurata!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.920
You are <i>not</i>  getting away with this!

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.720
Mercurimon!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.730
Falcomon, we have to treat him!

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:02.970
Don't waste your time.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.630
That wound makes him past the point of saving.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:06.650
You bastard!

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:09.540
How dare you attack from behind like a coward!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.370
Digimon are dangerous beings who only bring harm to us humans.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.240
We can't allow them to live any longer.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.040
They <i>must</i>  be destroyed!

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:20.240
What?!

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.900
Let me put it very simply.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:24.420
My goal is...

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.160
Digimon genocide!

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.330
Digimon...

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:28.830
Genocide?!

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.920
Unbelievable!

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.250
You manipulated us for that purpose?

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:38.630
From my experiences in the Digital World Exploration Squad ten years ago...

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:45.140
I learned first-hand the true savage nature of the Digimon.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.240
S-Stay away from me!

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.180
Stay away!

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:50.190
I realized that Digimon will only bring destruction to humans and that they must be destroyed!

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.200
Even my greatest obstacle, Mercurimon, is now knocking on death's door.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:59.700
Now I can finally commence my plans for Digimon annihilation.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.950
You're wrong!

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.910
Humans and Digimon can co-exist!

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.020
That's right!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.120
Just like us!

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.470
Just like me and Agumon...

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:14.040
If we'd talked through fists, we could've come to an understanding with Mercurimon!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:15.830
And yet, you...!

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.080
Why are you so angry?

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:21.180
I'm just getting rid of one Digimon!

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:22.630
You bastard!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.980
Looks like you won't get it until I punch you out!

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.060
Gizmon:AT!

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:29.680
Fall back!

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:30.830
Hold it right there!

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.710
This thing...

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:39.820
Gizmon:AT

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:39.820
Adult Level

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.210
Gizmon:AT.

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.090
Adult Level.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:39.820
Nothing else is known about it beyond its name.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.540
This makes for good entertainment!

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.760
Let me show you Gizmon's strength!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.160
Don't look down on me!

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.040
Take this!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.330
Let's go, Agumon!

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.280
Digisoul...

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.890
Full Charge!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.130
Yeah!

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:09.340
Agumon, evolve!

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:20.900
RiseGreymon!

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.730
Trident Revolver!

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.080
You got 'im!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.110
RiseGreymon!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.840
It's not hurt at all!

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.910
What a strong defense!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:43.940
Damn it!

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:46.790
You should've tested how strong it was before you jumped in!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:47.710
Shut up!

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:50.340
Digisoul...

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:55.680
Full Charge!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.260
Gaomon, evolve!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.120
MachGaogamon!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.480
Digisoul...

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:20.650
Full Charge!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:26.820
Lalamon, evolve!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.440
Lilamon!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.140
MachGaogamon!

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.110
Yes, Master!

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:47.050
Gaoga Tornado!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.830
You're finished!

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.280
It disappeared?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:02.860
MachGaogamon!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.050
Gaoga Tornado had no affect on it!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.430
Lilamon!

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:08.840
Use Un Deux Pollen!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.050
Un Deux Pollen!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.350
Now, let your heart be captivated by my pollen!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.030
Lilamon!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.110
Damn it!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.320
Bewitching attacks won't work!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.180
After all, Gizmon has no heart!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.490
It has no heart?

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.110
Yes, that's right.

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:41.330
I created this new Digimon from the Digimon that I'd captured and modified.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.000
You <i>modified</i>  Digimon?!

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.080
No way...

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.180
How could you do that to them?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:54.430
He erased its emotions to turn it into a doll that'll simply obey his orders.

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.320
What do you think?

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.170
Such strength at only the Adult Level!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.820
Adult Level?!

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:04.440
Gizmon will fight exactly as I tell it to.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:08.430
Digimon are only useful when you use them as tools.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.100
Digimon as tools?!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.200
Oh yes.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:16.470
If you agree to cooperate with me in annihilating the Digimon,

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:19.780
I'm willing to let your Digimon live.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.170
What?!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:24.100
Are you going to act against me?

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.700
I'm a part of the Ministry of Confidentiality.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.030
If you oppose, you'll be convicted of treason.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.640
I'll <i>never</i>  support you of my own free will!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.030
Digimon are wonderful living beings who have hearts!

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:38.480
I can't allow you to get away with controlling their minds and killing them!

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:39.810
Kurata!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.600
I'm going to kick your ass!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.150
My, my.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.190
I see you haven't grown tired of playing yet.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.890
Gizmon:AT!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.550
Mercurimon, hang in there!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:07:00.370
Something about that Digimon's attack is eating away at this wound.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.870
It won't heal no matter what you do.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.460
Mercurimon!

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:07.850
Ikuto, listen to me.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:11.060
I've always been in doubt.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.610
The human world or the Digital World...

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:20.120
I wondered which one would be the most suitable for you to live in happiness.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.840
Since you didn't know of anything beyond the Digital World,

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:26.150
I wondered what you would think upon meeting humans.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:29.550
Will your human heart be reawakened?

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:32.370
Or will you continue to hate them?

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:35.140
I wanted to know the answer to that.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.370
But...

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:41.990
now I realize that the doubt I felt... was wrong.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:48.030
What will bring you happiness isn't choosing one from the other.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:54.480
It's creating a world where both humans and Digimon can live together.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.090
That man...

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.760
Daimon Suguru... was aware of that.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.730
What is this?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.770
A Digivice.

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:06.600
It's a tool that connects the hearts of humans and Digimon together.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.730
I'm sure that Ikuto-kun will need one for himself one day.

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.560
Let's make one!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:14.320
A world where Digimon and humans can live together!

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.150
Yeah, let's do it!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.460
A world where both humans and Digimon live together...

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.140
In that case, Yukidarumon also knew!

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.440
Remember, Ikuto?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:33.190
The last words she said to you!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.090
Listen to me carefully, Ikuto.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.340
You must never hate the humans...

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:45.480
Because, you are...

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.580
Mercurimon!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:52.850
Forgive me, Ikuto!

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:54.600
For my hesitation...

00:08:54.600 --> 00:09:00.260
and for being unable to keep my promises with Suguru and Yukidarumon!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.780
Mercurimon!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:03.720
Don't die!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.870
Don't you leave me behind, too!

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.220
Damn it!

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:18.020
Winning Knuckle!

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.100
Lilac Dagger!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.500
Good one!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.300
Don't think you can keep dodging all the time!

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:51.190
Masaru!

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:59.310
Isn't it obvious by now?

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:01.980
Our side is stronger and faster!

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.530
Why don't you just give up?

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.100
Yeah, right!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.200
I won't give up until I've kicked your ass!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.040
Really...

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:13.420
I'm getting quite annoyed by that persistent obstinacy of yours.

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:17.050
You're just like your father, Daimon Suguru.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.170
What?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.430
Ten years ago,

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:23.080
after learning of the potential menace the Digimon could bring,

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:29.270
I advised Daimon Suguru, who was my superior back then, to eliminate them before the situation got worse.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:31.560
He wouldn't listen.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.770
And now look at the results.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:40.230
Not only have they kept their vicious ways, but even ten years later,

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:45.830
the atrocious rampage of Digimon in our world has increased!

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:49.960
This is all because of Daimon Suguru's thick-headed obstinacy!

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.410
<i>I</i>  was right!

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.910
There's no choice but to obliterate the Digimon threat!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.060
Cut the crap!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:03.430
I'd rather have Dad be as stubborn as a mule than to be a coward like you!

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.420
What do you mean by that?

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.310
Listen up!

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.080
When you exchange fists with someone,

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.300
you're not just delivering pain!

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:13.570
Your heart hurts much more than the pain they receive!

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:19.790
The way you're punching them one-sidedly just shows that you're a coward who's afraid of pain!

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:22.350
<i>You are a coward.</i>

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.810
You're exactly like him.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:28.680
I wanted to play around with you a little more,

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.950
but now I've changed my mind!

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:33.290
I'll have you disappear along with the Digimon...

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.920
in a freak "accident" in this foreign world!

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:37.130
What's that?

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.560
Gizmon:AT, evolve!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.640
It evolved?!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.720
What do you think?

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:02.650
It used an artificial Digisoul to undergo a pseudo-evolution!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.610
Pseudo-evolution?

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:05.930
Yes!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:10.990
Gizmon:AT has been reborn into its Perfect Level, Gizmon:XT!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:19.580
Gizmon:XT

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:19.580
Perfect Level

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:13.430
Gizmon:XT.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:16.930
A Perfect Level Digimon that has evolved through pseudo-evolution using an artificial Digisoul.

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:19.580
Its real identity is shrouded in mystery.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:20.790
Now...

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:24.510
Let's begin the second stage!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.920
Such destructive power!

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.610
This is the worst.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:51.380
Damn it!

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:53.320
In that case, we'll just have to attack as one!

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.030
Let's go!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:54.550
Yeah.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:54.550
Yeah.

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.810
No way are we gonna lose to a beam!

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.730
Let's do this!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.080
Lila Shower!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:01.880
Howling Cannon!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.330
Rising Destroyer!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:20.850
Take that!

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.230
No way...

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.410
It took on all three attacks at once, yet it's still in one piece!

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:37.780
Damn it!

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:39.390
We haven't lost yet!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.590
It's no use.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:46.850
Suguru's son and his companions can't win at their current level.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.900
This is farewell, Ikuto, Falcomon!

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:54.650
No!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:55.610
Mercurimon!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.020
The thing Yukidarumon told me, I...

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.190
I finally understand!

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:02.100
But I still don't like this!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.500
I really do hate humans after all!

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.980
They do something so horrible to you, Mercurimon...

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:12.220
I'll never forgive them for this!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.440
Look upon him, Ikuto.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.470
He's a simple-minded fellow who speaks crudely

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.340
and his actions are preposterous.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:28.450
I won't lose...

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.570
But is he a bad guy?

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.870
Do you hate him so much

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.510
that you wish he didn't exist?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.810
<i>You better clean well, or else Chika will come after you.</i>

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.730
<i>Okay...</i>

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.940
<i>Hey, is it...</i>

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:48.650
<i>Is it really okay for me to... be here?</i>

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:53.360
<i>Of course it is.</i>

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:59.080
Masaru let me meet my real parents.

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:02.180
Not just him.

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:03.270
Tohma,

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.420
Yoshino,

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.500
Chika,

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.040
and Masaru's mother...

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:09.680
Everyone treated me nicely.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.050
Do you hate them?

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:40.580
By now, you should know who you are really supposed to hate.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.040
Mercurimon!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.360
Ikuto...

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.460
Live...

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.960
as a human with a Digimon's heart.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:20.240
Mercurimon!

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.630
Why did you help us?!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.830
I wanted to try believing once more...

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:32.640
in what your father, Daimon Suguru, said...

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:36.660
That a time will come when humans and Digimon can live together in harmony.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.530
Harmony between humans and Digimon?

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:53.140
That day will never come!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.070
I-Ikuto...!

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:58.190
Be strong...!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.490
MERCURIMON!

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.590
Mercurimon...

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:25.940
How dare he make a mess of my masterpiece!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:31.450
Really, he just refused to die, and he was a hindrance to me to the very end.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:37.280
Digimon like him are known as fools the very second they even <i>think</i>  about defying humans!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.740
A time of co-existence between humans and Digimon?

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:44.560
He threw away his life for an empty fantasy like that?

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.360
I'm speechless by the sheer absurdity of it!

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:49.620
<i>Ikuto...</i>

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:50.940
<i>Live...</i>

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.310
<i>as a human with a Digimon's heart.</i>

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:56.960
Let's go, Falcomon!

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:02.440
I've played around too much. Now this is the end!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:03.850
Kurata!

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:08.640
Ikuto!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:15.110
This is revenge for Mercurimon!

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.380
Digisoul...

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.680
Full Charge!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.070
Falcomon, evolve!

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:51.290
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:51.290
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:56.250
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:56.250
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:54.400
Yatagaramon!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.360
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.360
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:06.490
Yatagaramon

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:06.490
Perfect Level

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.110
Yatagaramon.

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:00.500
A Perfect Level Digimon with three legs.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:01.980
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:01.980
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.530
His special attack is Mikafutsu-no-kami.

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:06.790
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:06.790
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:06.490
The energy produced in the cobalt pestles on both wings is fired from his forefeet!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:07.850
What?

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.010
He evolved to Perfect Level?

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.910
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.910
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:11.250
Mercurimon.

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:14.200
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:14.200
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.450
I get it now!

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:14.760
It's not Masaru and the others I should hate!

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:19.470
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:19.470
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.880
It's humans with evil hearts!

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.250
Yatagaramon!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:25.270
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:25.270
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.010
Waste him!

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:31.440
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:31.440
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:37.690
Go!

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.130
Mikafutsu-no-kami!

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:44.200
NOTE: <i>Mikafutsu-no-kami</i> (甕布都神), according to Shinto mythology, is the name of a divine sword that Japan's founder and first emperor, Jinmu, used while he was assisted by the three-legged crow, Yatagarasu.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:52.040
Hey.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.180
Yes, sir.

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:56.580
Oh, crap!

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:57.790
Hold it!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.520
Mercurimon...

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:07.300
I... will live as a human.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:10.020
A human with a Digimon's heart.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:11.080
Ikuto.

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:16.330
All right.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:17.690
Let's go after Kurata!

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:24.360
One of my masterpieces was defeated,

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:27.860
but I still have much more in store.

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.130
Much, much more.

